0 FILE 10218 - Blue House 2 Downstairs.ldr
0 Ground floor of the blue house: large floor plates, sand-blue brick walls with log detailing, an open staircase, a kitchen (frypan, tap, cups), a fireplace with neon-orange flame, glazed windows and panelled doors, finished with slopes, arches and tiles
